<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Peringatan Stok Menipis</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f6f9fc;
      color: #333333;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .email-wrapper {
      width: 100%;
      background-color: #f6f9fc;
      padding: 30px 0;
    }
    .email-content {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    }
    .email-header {
      background-color: #e53e3e;
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 24px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .email-header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .email-body {
      padding: 30px;
    }
    .email-body p {
      margin-top: 0;
      color: #4a5568;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .stock-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .stock-table th, .stock-table td {
      padding: 12px;
      text-align: left;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #edf2f7;
    }
    .stock-table th {
      background-color: #f7fafc;
      color: #2d3748;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .stock-table td {
      color: #4a5568;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .badge-stock {
      background-color: #fed7d7;
      color: #9b2c2c;
      padding: 4px 8px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 12px;
    }
    .email-footer {
      background-color: #f7fafc;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #a0aec0;
    }
    .btn-action {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 20px;
      background-color: #3182ce;
      color: #ffffff;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="email-wrapper">
    <div class="email-content">
      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="email-header">
        <h1>⚠️ Peringatan: Stok Produk Menipis</h1>
      </div>

      <!-- Body -->
      <div class="email-body">
        <p>Halo Admin,</p>
        <p>Sistem mendeteksi adanya beberapa produk yang memiliki sisa stok di bawah batas minimum (<= 5). Harap segera melakukan *restock* untuk produk-produk berikut:</p>

        <!-- Tabel Produk -->
        <table class="stock-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Nama Produk</th>
              <th style="text-align: center;">Sisa Stok</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {{#each products}}
            <tr>
              <td><strong>{{this.title}}</strong></td>
              <td style="text-align: center;">
                <span class="badge-stock">{{this.stock}} pcs</span>
              </td>
            </tr>
            {{/each}}
          </tbody>
        </table>

        <p>Segera perbarui inventaris Anda melalui panel admin untuk menghindari kehabisan stok bagi pelanggan.</p>

        <a href="{{adminUrl}}" class="btn-action" target="_blank">Buka Panel Admin</a>
      </div>

      <!-- Footer -->
      <div class="email-footer">
        <p>&copy; {{currentYear}} Sistem Otomasi Toko Anda. Email ini dikirim otomatis oleh sistem Cron Job.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>